  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've noticed that when I time-out or my internet disconnects briefly, I stop getting notifications (invites and friend requests) from inside the game. I've also noticed that the statuses of my friends stops updating, which includes if they're online and what lobby they're in. This problem persists even after my connection stabilizes.\n\nI have a multi-WAN setup because sometimes my main ISP drops out. And when that happens, I often end up in the \"Something Went Wrong\" world. It happens so often I take a selfie every time it happens and put it in a little folder called \"Second Home\"\n\nHopefully those repro steps help.",
